The base is computed from the card pictures of Scryfall (https://scryfall.com), fetched the way its API documentation asks: one call to the /bulk-data endpoint, the
"Unique Artwork" bulk file for the list, the image servers for the pictures. The base holds Scryfall's `illustration_id` of each artwork and numbers computed from a small
reduction of its picture; it holds no picture, no name, no text and no price. This project is not affiliated with, and not endorsed by, Scryfall.

